## Sample torrc for the demo screenshots
Nickname NebulaGuard
ContactInfo admin@example.org
ORPort 9001
ControlPort 9051
CookieAuthentication 1
CookieAuthFile /run/tor/control.authcookie
CookieAuthFileGroupReadable 1

RelayBandwidthRate 12 MBytes
RelayBandwidthBurst 24 MBytes
AccountingMax 2 TBytes
AccountingStart month 1 00:00

ExitRelay 0
ExitPolicy reject *:*

HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/dashboard/
HiddenServicePort 80 127.0.0.1:8080
HiddenServiceVersion 3
